        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLnr01A2Dq8encWgNypV9s49MDTDUM5bylVkRJZgbYRjL225s9=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great service from start to finish! This is the only drilling company that was able to answer our many questions on day one of our well drilling process. Every step was explained to us very clearly throughout the drilling process, which we greatly appreciated! We always had the right information with them! We thank them for the work they did for us! A great team!",
        "time": 1729951672,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Yves Despatis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105051691347932707785/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKOjf9HAsA8ODWbgyfAS9Cxc1K9EzHfToZjto-akBE0Gtz0-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Forage St-Denis dug our well in 2019. Unfortunately, just two years later, our pump stopped working, and we were left without water.\nDespite their very limited availability due to the construction boom, they arrived the same morning we called to correct the situation. They removed the faulty pump and installed a new one—a daunting task, with 350 feet of pipe to remove from the well.\nFinally, less than two hours after our call, water was back in the house.\n\nThank you to the St-Denis team, especially François and Claude!\n\nGreat after-sales service!",
        "time": 1623768038,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michel Robidoux",
